<title>USA: Major states-U.S. cotton intended plantings.</title>
<headline>Major states-U.S. cotton intended plantings.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA 1997 cotton planting intentions in major states, 1,000 acres (Pct 97/96):</p>
<p> UPLAND -   PCT----IND'97--PLANT'96   PLANT'95</p>
<p> -   Ala    102     550.0     540.0	590.0</p>
<p> -   Ark     97     970.0   1,000.0    1,170.0</p>
<p> -   Cal     90     900.0   1,000.0    1,170.0</p>
<p> -   Ga     104   1,400.0   1,350.0    1,500.0</p>
<p> -   La	75     670.0     890.0    1,085.0</p>
<p> -   Miss    98   1,100.0   1,120.0    1,460.0</p>
<p> -   Texas  104   5,900.0   5,700.0    6,400.0</p>
<p> -   U.S.    99  14,239.5  14,407.5   16,716.8</p>
